# Final Recommendation

## Assessment Outcome

Conditionally Approved

ChatGPT Enterprise may be approved for limited organizational deployment provided that governance, security, and compliance controls are implemented prior to production use.

## Required Controls

- Human review of AI-generated outputs
- Role-based access control (RBAC)
- Multi-factor authentication (MFA)
- Data classification policy
- Acceptable-use policy
- Security awareness training
- Periodic risk reviews
- Logging and monitoring

## Residual Risk

Moderate

The organization can reduce risk to an acceptable level through governance controls, monitoring, user accountability, and continuous risk management activities.

## Next Review

Annual review or upon significant changes to organizational AI usage, regulatory requirements, or vendor capabilities.
